    "panelClass": {
      "review_item": "R9",
      "status": "withheld",
      "note": "LOINC 85354-9 is `proposed` in the code table and therefore yields source-only. Concept note section 2: a FHIR code literal alone is not an OWL class assertion. Option A adds `rdf:type IRI %Map:{ v:panelClass %}` to sh:BPPanelRecordNode and one vocabulary entry here; option B (current) emits nothing. tests/contracts/maps/test_bp_gate3.py asserts the panel record carries no domain type beyond recordClass, so flipping this is a visible change."
    }
